                    <span class="stars-fill" style={`width:${starWidth}`}>★★★★★</span>
                  </span>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[var(--muted)]">{rating.countLabel} na review · Market</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--muted)]">
                评分与评价数同步自谷歌地图（Google Maps）用户评价 · {ratingSyncedAt} ·
                <a class="font-bold underline decoration-[var(--market-orange)] decoration-2 underline-offset-4" href={mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">点击查看谷歌地图全部评价↗</a>
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-[var(--muted)]">同步自 Google 地图用户评价，同步时间 {ratingSyncedAt}；版权归原作者与 Google 地图所有</p>
              <a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-2 border-[var(--ink)] bg-[var(--market-orange)] px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[.12em] shadow-[5px_5px_0_var(--ink)] transition hover:-translate-y-1" href={mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">
                在谷歌地图查看全部评价 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--muted)]">Ang rating at bilang ng review ay ipinapakita dito bilang sanggunian ng mga biyahero; ang tunay at pinakabagong review ay nasa Google Maps listing ng Carbon Market.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

