                <a class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[.12em] underline decoration-[var(--market-orange)] decoration-2 underline-offset-4" href={mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Buksan sa Google Maps <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
